@format 1
@id preferences.persist
@title Persist preference change
@area 8. Preferences and tools
@entry input
@summary Coalesce high-frequency preference changes and write the latest normalized preference state after the defer interval.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related preferences.apply

@alias preference = Cadroue.UIShell.LPreference
@alias store = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LPreferenceStateStore

[input] Preference setter changes state <input>
- Update the relevant value in current preference state @ preference.LPreferenceStateSet(...)
> defer

[defer] Coalesce writes <process>
- Restart the preference save timer so a burst produces one write @ preference.LPreferenceDefer(...)
> persist

[persist] Write latest state <storage>
- Normalize and save the current preference state when the timer expires @ store.LPreferenceStateSave(...)
> result

[result] Preference durable <output>
= The latest normalized preference state is available to a future application start.
